  "quote": "The flowsheet consists of a three-stage crushing followed by ball mill to a target P 80 size of 50 microns. The facility will have two flotation circuits to recover copper and zinc (Figure 1-4). The copper and zinc circuits will see their respective concentrate filtered to reduce residual moisture content to approximately 10%. Both concentrates will be loaded for shipment to smelters. Figure 1-4: Process Flow Diagram (Processing section) Zinc flotation tailings will be leached and dewatered using a press filter. Solids will be washed and dewatered to 15% humidity in the press filter before being sent to dry stack.",
  "page": 40
 },
